\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n************* Module gzip\r\ngzip:5:0: W0406: Module import itself (import-self)\r\ngzip:7:0: E1101: Module 'gzip' has no 'main' member (no-member)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\npylint shouldn't think a program named \"foo\" can be imported as \"foo\" when it doesn't have a .py extension\r\n\r\n### Pylint version\r\n\r\n```shell\r\npylint 2.14.5\r\nastroid 2.11.7\r\nPython 3.9.2 (default, Feb 28 2021, 17:03:44) \r\n[GCC 10.2.1 20210110]\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### OS / Environment\r\n\r\nLinux\r\n\r\n### Additional dependencies\r\n\r\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/7289/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/7289/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]